     "4b08189b-63a0-4b6a-86b2-50c83dbd0250"], Cell["\<\
1: the causal future is a set, and its support is its only member\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"dd4df15c-392f-4594-8a61-07b7c1dca91a"]},
